# InteractAI — see CLAUDE.md §12 and docs/phase-0-BUILD.md TASK 0.1.
# Explicitly required: .env, models/, *.wav/*.pcm/*.opus, kaggle.json, wandb/, data/raw/.
#
# NOT ignored on purpose — do not add these later:
#   content/                              authored YAML data, not a build artefact
#   packages/schema generated output      committed; CI's schema-drift job diffs against it
#   uv.lock, pnpm-lock.yaml               lockfiles, always committed
#   tests/fixtures/audio/                 committed audio fixtures (see exception below)

# ── Secrets & environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
kaggle.json
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
certs/
secrets/

# ── Python — services/{api,realtime,coach,training} ────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
wheels/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.cover
.tox/
.nox/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Node / pnpm / Next.js — apps/web, packages/schema ───────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.pnp.*
.next/
out/
.turbo/
.vercel
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
coverage/

# ── Docker ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docker-compose.override.yml

# ── Models, weights & ML training artefacts ─────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md: never commit weights. Downloaded by docs/01-SETUP-GUIDE.md §3.
# Anchored to the repo root (leading slash) — an unanchored `models/` also matches
# services/api/app/models/, which is SQLAlchemy ORM code, not a weights directory, and was
# silently untracked by this exact bug until Phase 3 (docs/PROGRESS.md).
/models/
wandb/
checkpoints/
runs/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors
# Anchored, and specifically NOT a blanket `data/` — data/boundaries/ (eval_report.json,
# labels.jsonl, README.md) is a real Phase 1 deliverable, not a build artefact, and an
# unanchored `data/` silently swallowed it. Only the two genuinely ephemeral subdirectories are
# ignored: services/realtime's local WAV scratch space, and (future, Phase 5) a raw-dataset dump.
/data/recordings/
/data/raw/

# ── Audio & media ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md §1.8: never store persona audio — regenerable from transcript + voice id.
*.wav
*.pcm
*.opus
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.m4a
!tests/fixtures/audio/**

# ── Editors & IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Logs & runtime ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
*.pid
*.tmp
tmp/
.cache/
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
